{"ID":"20240118151056-zq8hjag","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151056-zq8hjag","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151056-zq8hjag\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151056-inaquzy\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122141206-haw8p9c\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122141206-haw8p9c\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:89,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:89\u0026#125;","title":"239鮀鱼甲240樗鸡","type":"doc","updated":"20240202094624"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151056-inaquzy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151056-inaquzy","updated":"20240122141141"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"鮀鱼甲"}]},{"ID":"20240122141141-ifp7oad","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122141141-ifp7oad","updated":"20240122141147"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味辛，微温，有毒。治心腹症瘕，伏坚积聚，寒热，女子崩中下血五色，小腹阴中相引痛，疮疥死肌。生南海池泽。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122141147-r8jyl60","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122141147-r8jyl60"}},{"ID":"20240122141151-g2aiqxd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122141151-g2aiqxd","updated":"20240202094611"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"239鮀鱼甲，这个字念tuo。鮀鱼是鲨鱼的一种，这种现在用的很少。生南海，取无时。有毒。现在用的很少。"}]},{"ID":"20240122141153-t9zz9y2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122141153-t9zz9y2"}},{"ID":"20240122141154-kltr03i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122141154-kltr03i","updated":"20240122141200"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"樗鸡"}]},{"ID":"20240122141200-hg5t1np","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122141200-hg5t1np","updated":"20240122141205"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味苦，平，有小毒。治心腹邪气，阴痿，益精，强志，生子色，补中，轻身。生川谷樗树上。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122141205-2qtw3oy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122141205-2qtw3oy"}},{"ID":"20240122141206-haw8p9c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122141206-haw8p9c","updated":"20240202094624"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"240是一种鸡，野鸡类的东西，动物性的东西。生子好颜色啊，补中啊。一般来说山鸡类的东西呢，都有滋补的功能，诸位看看就好了。你不要去开樗鸠两只，没有。药房没有的。这个可以吃没有关系，入药很难的。"}]}]}